plugin-hostd (0.10.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * release: plugin-hostd 0.10.0
  * sabotage: the two descriptors.c targets follow the panel stage's rewrite
    (#157)
  * panel.md: the format tables stay strict (#156)
  * panel_wire: assert fixed values of omx-delay and the fake compressor
    (#156)
  * panel.md: point paramId at the code that takes it (#156)
  * panel.md: only a null panel means no layout (#156)
  * panel_get on the wire against the installed scanner and real plugins
    (#150)
  * panel_get <uri>: the panel the plugin publishes, filed by the scan of its
    add (#150)
  * tests: the panel fixtures are omx-clap-scan 0.20.0's own words (#150)
  * plugin-hostd-probe panel: the panel object omx-clap-scan --json prints
    for a plugin (#150)
  * describe reads the panel scopes of omx-clap-scan 0.20.0's dump as drops
    (#150)

 -- Pau Aliagas <linuxnow@gmail.com>  Sun, 25 Oct 2026 04:24:05 +0000
